    "updated_at": "2022-01-22T02:11:27Z",
    "body": "[`insertRule`](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#dom-cssstylesheet-insertrule) doesn't affect the contents of the style element. It adds a rule to the existing stylesheet object.\r\n\r\nDisconnecting a style element from the document and inserting back elsewhere has an effect of re-creating the stylesheet object from the style element's child text nodes.",
